{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は、本当に暑い☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうそろそろ、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏って言ってもいいですか！！？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一人暮らしをしてからは、\n朝にテレビで天気予報を見る習慣がすっかりなくなっちゃって！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気づいたらその日の気温も空模様も、\n家を出た瞬間に知る生活になってました🌤️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だから、\n今日こんな暑かったの！？\nってびっくりしてる日がよくあります！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "雨の日は、前まではちゃんと折りたたみ傘を持って行ったりしてたのに、、最近は、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "帽子のパールさえ守れば！！\n駅までちょっと走ればいっか〜！って思えるようになってしまいました(^_^)笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いやぁ\n今年の梅雨、夏は、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうなっちゃうんだろうかね〜〜！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とりあえず、皆さん！\nちゃんと水分とって、無理せず過ごしましょうね☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょっと前の！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "04.29（水）　幕張メッセ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobb9gVwj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41st シングルのリアルミート＆グリート！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobf6WuUs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都の前に幕張メッセでありました！！\n今回はリアミが近かったですね^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "振り返ったら、\n白のお洋服とリボンをめっちゃ着てました🎀🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっぱりミーグリってなったら前から見て可愛いやつだったり、パッとすぐ目に入って可愛い印象のリボンを選びがちなんですよ、わたしって人は。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回は買った後に、全部リボンだったことに気がついたのです(^_^;)笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということで、次はどんなの着ようかな。。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何があるかな、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんなのが好き？何が似合うかな？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆んな〜、どう思う？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobSNw9qE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いやぁー楽しかったね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いっぱい話せて幸せチャーーーージ✨✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛いお花たちもいただきました(T_T)"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mob1k6hBs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {